{"claim_id": "RXRE-SWF-012", "taxonomy": "MEASUREMENT", "state": "PROVEN", "statement": "Formato AVM1 ConstantPool (estandar): 0x88, u16 ActionLength, u16 Count, luego Count cadenas NUL-terminadas. El Count es el SEGUNDO u16; el primero es ActionLength (mal etiquetado 'campoA' en avm1_strings.py). El ConstantPool ES accion autonoma real: 456 acciones 0x88 standalone (walk_actions), 456 scripts con pool valido, 9801 cadenas. DoAction[0] count=23 (rightClick, ContextMenu, hideBuiltInItems, _root, menu, MadnessWorldMap, world_map, Object...).", "evidence": "tools/avm1_disasm.py walk_actions; 456 acciones 0x88", "rxre_kind": "claim", "rxre_response": {"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "ok", "operation": "record", "target": null, "results": [{"estado": "ok", "id": 187, "kind": "claim", "status": "OPEN", "gap_kind": null, "refs": [], "session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T17:02:28-0300"}], "evidence": [], "provenance": [], "limitations": [], "tools_used": [], "recorded": {"estado": "ok", "id": 187, "kind": "claim", "status": "OPEN", "gap_kind": null, "refs": [], "session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T17:02:28-0300"}, "session": "swf-nexus", "next_actions": [{"description": "leer el checkpoint de esta sesion", "op": "checkpoint", "args": {"session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf"}, "available": true, "request": {"session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "op": "checkpoint"}}], "contract_version": "1.0", "engine_version": "0.2.0"}}
{"claim_id": "RXRE-SWF-023", "taxonomy": "HYPOTHESIS", "state": "OPEN", "statement": "Los multiplicadores de combate float32, concentrados en 15 scripts, forman 2 grupos de pool compartido. Grupo A (combate general: tac, damage, health, melee, headshot, block, zombie) es dominante en 1.75(74), luego 1.9125(33), 1.925(25), 1.9375(18). Grupo B (point-blank/personajes: blank, sanford, deimos, christoff, pellet, evade, finisher, doubletime, second, carry) usa 1.9125(23-28), 1.925(15-22), 1.9375(5) y NO contiene 1.75. Evidencia de co-ocurrencia (HYPOTHESIS), NO prueba de flujo de control: el mapeo exacto constante->mecanica sigue NOT_DETERMINED.", "evidence": "tools/avm1_disasm.py; correlacion pool->multiplicador", "rxre_kind": "hypothesis", "rxre_response": {"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "ok", "operation": "record", "target": null, "results": [{"estado": "ok", "id": 188, "kind": "hypothesis", "status": "OPEN", "gap_kind": null, "refs": [], "session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T17:02:28-0300"}], "evidence": [], "provenance": [], "limitations": [], "tools_used": [], "recorded": {"estado": "ok", "id": 188, "kind": "hypothesis", "status": "OPEN", "gap_kind": null, "refs": [], "session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T17:02:28-0300"}, "session": "swf-nexus", "next_actions": [{"description": "leer el checkpoint de esta sesion", "op": "checkpoint", "args": {"session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf"}, "available": true, "request": {"session": "swf-nexus", "target": "Madness Project Nexus Classic.swf", "op": "checkpoint"}}], "contract_version": "1.0", "engine_version": "0.2.0"}}
